    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2745580/extras/9923fed49e0a871a624c2d290dba3ac5.avif?t=1729885109\" width=575 height=281 /></span><br>You are a Viking who seems to have finally arrived Valhalla, however... Are you still not worthy to enter? Live an adventure in a fantasy world inspired by the lore of the Streamer Carola and prove to the Gods that you are worthy of entering Valhalla<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2745580/extras/da57cd4ef86bb03b336f656cb9e9d158.avif?t=1729885109\" width=600 height=338 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Live adventures during the day!</h2>Travel around the world and complete different missions to advance your adventure. Defeating enemies, finding resources, and even fighting bosses, the adventurer's guild welcomes all kinds of help.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2745580/extras/ca5748bb2b657ecca1f3e6e64c7777e4.poster.avif?t=1729885109\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2745580/extras/ca5748bb2b657ecca1f3e6e64c7777e4.webm?t=1729885109\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2745580/extras/ca5748bb2b657ecca1f3e6e64c7777e4.mp4?t=1729885109\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Live like Carola during the night!</h2>Do Carola's different favorite activities at night. Get drunk in the different pubs and taverns in the villages, show off how handsome you are to others and even organize DJ sets and make everyone dance.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2745580/extras/51dea8c83e1cb84e33faf734fdd7b6cf.poster.avif?t=1729885109\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2745580/extras/51dea8c83e1cb84e33faf734fdd7b6cf.webm?t=1729885109\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2745580/extras/51dea8c83e1cb84e33faf734fdd7b6cf.mp4?t=1729885109\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Meet old friends!</h2>In this world you will meet your old friends, reconcile and gather your 3 Valkyries to save the world from an imminent tragic fate.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2745580/extras/d56d2d1faf0dd485b04902836c236219.avif?t=1729885109\" width=600 height=360 /></span>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2745580/extras/9923fed49e0a871a624c2d290dba3ac5.avif?t=1729885109\" width=575 height=281 /></span><br>You are a Viking who seems to have finally arrived Valhalla, however... Are you still not worthy to enter? Live an adventure in a fantasy world inspired by the lore of the Streamer Carola and prove to the Gods that you are worthy of entering Valhalla<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2745580/extras/da57cd4ef86bb03b336f656cb9e9d158.avif?t=1729885109\" width=600 height=338 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Live adventures during the day!</h2>Travel around the world and complete different missions to advance your adventure. Defeating enemies, finding resources, and even fighting bosses, the adventurer's guild welcomes all kinds of help.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2745580/extras/ca5748bb2b657ecca1f3e6e64c7777e4.poster.avif?t=1729885109\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2745580/extras/ca5748bb2b657ecca1f3e6e64c7777e4.webm?t=1729885109\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2745580/extras/ca5748bb2b657ecca1f3e6e64c7777e4.mp4?t=1729885109\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Live like Carola during the night!</h2>Do Carola's different favorite activities at night. Get drunk in the different pubs and taverns in the villages, show off how handsome you are to others and even organize DJ sets and make everyone dance.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2745580/extras/51dea8c83e1cb84e33faf734fdd7b6cf.poster.avif?t=1729885109\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2745580/extras/51dea8c83e1cb84e33faf734fdd7b6cf.webm?t=1729885109\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2745580/extras/51dea8c83e1cb84e33faf734fdd7b6cf.mp4?t=1729885109\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Meet old friends!</h2>In this world you will meet your old friends, reconcile and gather your 3 Valkyries to save the world from an imminent tragic fate.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2745580/extras/d56d2d1faf0dd485b04902836c236219.avif?t=1729885109\" width=600 height=360 /></span>",
